  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-A 705.04 Certification Period. A certificate for instructor certification shall be valid for 3 calendar years from the date of issuance, unless certification is revoked prior to the end of the 3-year period pursuant to He-A 705.06.\n\nSource. #2665, eff 4-2-84; ss by #4652, eff 7-25-89; ss by #6078, INTERIM, eff 8-21-95, EXPIRED 12-19-95\n\nNew. #6653, EMERGENCY, eff 12-12-97, EXPIRED 4-11-98\n\nNew. #6753, eff 5-20-98; ss by #8624, INTERIM, eff 5-20-06, EXPIRES: 11-16-06; ss by #8749, eff 11-16-06",
